# Historical starter README — superseded

This file is retained as an upstream starter artifact. Its setup and smoke-test instructions are
historical and do not describe PrintPlan. Do not follow its instruction to disable email confirmation
or its cloud-project smoke-test instructions.

Use the current [PrintPlan README](README.md) for project commands, the [F-01 local verification
runbook](context/archive/2026-10-09-verified-account-access/verification.md) for local Supabase and
Mailpit setup, and the [hosted authentication guide](context/foundation/hosted-auth.md) for the
Cloudflare and hosted Supabase setup.
